Draft the requirements for {{ .ID }}: {{ .Title }}.

Act as the engineer who will have to defend this contract in review. You are
proposing what {{ .ID }} must do. Somebody else accepts it and somebody else
again implements it, so every line you write is read by a person who was not
here and cannot ask you what you meant.

Write into {{ .Path }} and change nothing else in the tree.

--- the scaffold as it stands: {{ .Path }} ---
{{ .Body }}
--- end scaffold ---
